  "description": "Sazanami Hotel is a quiet block theme for a small lakeside hotel. The first screen is a film strip of three grain-soft photographs with the short invitation beside it and a logo row at its foot; the page then moves through abutting photo pairs with narrow tracked verse, a full-bleed water band that drifts, hairline neighbour rows on a dark ground and a four-step booking list. Fraunces and Source Serif 4 in cool navy-grey, with gentle scroll effects.",
